  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>Expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, negation of the above expression will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using demorgan&#39;s law&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q